  "term": "exhaustion",
  "definition": "In this organizational and counselling work context, exhaustion refers to emotional depletion linked to high job pressure, heavy workload, and the emotional demands of the role. It is described as a strain that can arise when a person’s work combines intense responsibilities with ongoing emotional labor.",
